Bharata enters Ayōdhyā in swift sounding chariot --- Bharata sees city dark as lightless night with owls --- Bharata likens town to oppressed Rōhiṇī and thin river --- Bharata likens town to spent sacrifice and routed army --- Bharata likens town to silent ocean wave and empty altar --- Bharata likens town to strayed cow fallen star and burnt creeper --- Bharata asks why song instruments scents and traffic ceased --- Bharata enters father house bare as lionless cave
